Sinnoh_BattleFactory_Text_Person3:
	.string "In the BATTLE FACTORY you borrow\n"
	.string "MOéMON to battle! It's like a puzzle!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFactory_Text_Person4:
	.string "I love seeing which MOéMON I'll get to\n"
	.string "borrow. It's a surprise every time!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFactory_Text_Person5:
	.string "I keep things running smoothly here.\n"
	.string "And make sure nobody keeps the rental\l"
	.string "MOéMON.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFactory_Text_Person6:
	.string "A sailor knows how to make do with\n"
	.string "what he's got. That's the FACTORY's\l"
	.string "lesson!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFactory_Text_Person7:
	.string "Rental MOéMON are cute! But I miss my\n"
	.string "own.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFactory_Text_Person8:
	.string "Even a clown can win here with the\n"
	.string "right rentals!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFactory_Text_Person9:
	.string "The FACTORY tests your knowledge\n"
	.string "more than your team, darling.$"

